= render 'shared/site_page', page_title: 'Where to Buy', current_page: 'Where to Buy', page_subtitle: 'Get your professional pixel controller from trusted retailers worldwide', document_title: 'Where to Buy Baldrick Boards', meta: ['7 boards', '5 regions', 'Authorised retailers'], toc: where_to_buy_toc, toc_class: 'toc--releases' do
  p.lead The Baldrick family is available from several of our partners around the world. If your country isn't listed and you are interested in stocking Baldrick boards, please get in touch.

  .prose.buy-prose
    section#overview
      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
            path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
        div
          span.lbl Global availability
          p.bd Baldrick boards are available through our trusted network of authorised retailers worldwide. Each retailer has been carefully selected to provide excellent service and support.

    section#all-boards
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Retailers
        | By board

      - where_to_buy_boards.each do |board|
        = render 'pages/where_to_buy_board', board: board

    section#partners
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Network
        | Our trusted retail partners

      .spec-grid
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
              path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 0 1 4 10 15 15 0 0 1-4 10 15 15 0 0 1-4-10 15 15 0 0 1 4-10z"
          h4 Global coverage
          p
            | Baldrick boards ship through partners in the United Kingdom, United States, Australia, Netherlands and Canada — including
            = link_to ' Build a Light Show', 'https://buildalightshow.com/', target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', class: 'lnk'
            | , Gilbert Engineering, Wired Watts, Hanson Electronics, Propixeler and Light Show Factory.
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8zM22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"
          h4 Become a retailer
          p Interested in stocking Baldrick boards in your region? We're always looking to expand our global network of trusted partners.
          = link_to support_path, class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm' do
            | Contact us
            span.ar →

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Not sure which board you need?
    p Explore the range — pixel controllers, relays, inputs and more.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to boards_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Explore boards
        span.ar →
      = link_to about_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
        | About Baldrick
